      {
        "page_number": 94,
        "elements": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When covered by ice these instruments display incorrect ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              71.99542236328125,
              44.10983657836914,
              311.4853210449219,
              54.10983657836914
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "information thereby presenting serious hazard to instrument ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              71.99542236328125,
              56.60983657836914,
              311.4954833984375,
              66.60983276367188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "flight. Detailed information on the operation of these ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              71.99542236328125,
              69.10983276367188,
              311.3353271484375,
              79.10983276367188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "instruments and the specific effects of icing is presented in ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              71.99542236328125,
              81.60983276367188,
              311.5054931640625,
              91.60983276367188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chapter 5, Flight Instruments.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              71.99542236328125,
              94.10983276367188,
              192.27542114257812,
              104.10983276367188
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stall Warning Systems",
            "font_name": "Times-BoldItalic",
            "font_size": 11.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              119.09722900390625,
              174.6959991455078,
              130.09722900390625
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stall warning systems provide essential information to pilots. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              134.11318969726562,
              311.50018310546875,
              144.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "These systems range from a sophisticated stall warning vane ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              146.61318969726562,
              311.6000061035156,
              156.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "to a simple stall warning switch. Icing affects these systems ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              159.11318969726562,
              311.4700622558594,
              169.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "in several ways resulting in possible loss of stall warning to ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              171.61318969726562,
              311.49993896484375,
              181.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "the pilot. The loss of these systems can exacerbate an already ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              184.11318969726562,
              311.59002685546875,
              194.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "hazardous situation. Even when an aircraft’s stall warning ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              196.61318969726562,
              311.5000305175781,
              206.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "system remains operational during icing conditions, it may ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              209.11318969726562,
              311.510009765625,
              219.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "be ineffective because the wing stalls at a lower AOA due ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              221.61318969726562,
              311.4800109863281,
              231.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "to ice on the airfoil.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              234.11318969726562,
              150.60000610351562,
              244.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Windshields",
            "font_name": "Times-BoldItalic",
            "font_size": 11.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              259.09722900390625,
              127.62699127197266,
              270.09722900390625
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Accumulation of ice on flight deck windows can severely ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              274.1131896972656,
              311.50006103515625,
              284.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "restrict the pilot’s visibility outside of the aircraft. Aircraft ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              286.6131896972656,
              311.4999084472656,
              296.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "equipped for flight into known icing conditions typically have ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              299.1131896972656,
              311.3398132324219,
              309.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "some form of windshield anti-icing to enable the pilot to see ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              311.6131896972656,
              311.4800109863281,
              321.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "outside the aircraft in case icing is encountered in flight. One ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              324.1131896972656,
              311.4000244140625,
              334.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "system consists of an electrically heated plate installed onto ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              336.6131896972656,
              311.50006103515625,
              346.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "the airplane’s windshield to give the pilot a narrow band of ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              349.1131896972656,
              311.50994873046875,
              359.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "clear visibility. Another system uses a bar at the lower end ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              361.6131896972656,
              311.5099792480469,
              371.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "of the windshield to spray deicing fluid onto it and prevent ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              374.1131896972656,
              311.510009765625,
              384.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ice from forming. On high performance aircraft that require ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              386.6131896972656,
              311.4999694824219,
              396.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "complex windshields to protect against bird strikes and ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              399.1131896972656,
              311.6097717285156,
              409.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "withstand pressurization loads, the heating element often is ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              411.6131896972656,
              311.489990234375,
              421.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "a layer of conductive film or thin wire strands through which ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              424.1131896972656,
              311.4999694824219,
              434.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "electric current is run to heat the windshield and prevent ice ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              436.6131896972656,
              311.4800109863281,
              446.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "from forming.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              449.1131896972656,
              128.66000366210938,
              459.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Antenna Icing",
            "font_name": "Helvetica-Bold",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              474.14019775390625,
              138.1199951171875,
              484.14019775390625
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Because of their small size and shape, antennas that do not lay ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              487.1131896972656,
              311.5002136230469,
              497.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "flush with the aircraft’s skin tend to accumulate ice rapidly. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              499.6131896972656,
              311.510009765625,
              509.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Furthermore, they often are devoid of internal anti-icing ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              512.1132202148438,
              311.5703125,
              522.1132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "or deicing capability for protection. During flight in icing ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              524.6132202148438,
              311.4900207519531,
              534.6132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "conditions, ice accumulations on an antenna may cause it to ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              537.1132202148438,
              311.49005126953125,
              547.1132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "begin to vibrate or cause radio signals to become distorted ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              549.6132202148438,
              311.4900207519531,
              559.6132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and it may cause damage to the antenna. If a frozen antenna ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              562.1132202148438,
              311.4900207519531,
              572.1132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "breaks off, it can damage other areas of the aircraft in addition ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              574.6132202148438,
              311.3101806640625,
              584.6132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "to causing a communication or navigation system failure.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              587.1132202148438,
              301.41998291015625,
              597.1132202148438
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Summary",
            "font_name": "Helvetica-Bold",
            "font_size": 12.0,
            "color": "#EF4044",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              610.6815185546875,
              126.46797180175781,
              622.6815185546875
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ice-contaminated aircraft have been involved in many ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              628.1632080078125,
              311.30999755859375,
              638.1632080078125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "accidents. Takeoff accidents have usually been due to failure ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              640.6632080078125,
              311.3200988769531,
              650.6632080078125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "to deice or anti-ice critical surfaces properly on the ground. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              653.1632080078125,
              311.5000305175781,
              663.1632080078125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Proper deicing and anti-icing procedures are addressed in ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              665.6632080078125,
              311.4900207519531,
              675.6632080078125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "two other pilot guides, Advisory Circular (AC) 120-58, Pilot ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              678.1632080078125,
              311.5599670410156,
              688.1632080078125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Guide: Large Aircraft Ground Deicing and AC 135-17, Pilot ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              690.6632080078125,
              311.44000244140625,
              700.6632080078125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Guide: Small Aircraft Ground Deicing.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              703.1632080078125,
              228.92001342773438,
              713.1632080078125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The pilot of an aircraft, which is not certificated or equipped ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              44.11319351196289,
              560.510009765625,
              54.11319351196289
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "for flight in icing conditions, should avoid all icing conditions. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              56.61319351196289,
              560.5104370117188,
              66.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The aforementioned guides provide direction on how to do ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              69.11318969726562,
              560.5099487304688,
              79.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "this, and on how to exit icing conditions promptly and safely ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              81.61318969726562,
              560.5101318359375,
              91.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "should they be inadvertently encountered.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              94.11318969726562,
              488.4700012207031,
              104.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The pilot of an aircraft, which is certificated for flight in ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              119.11318969726562,
              560.5504760742188,
              129.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "icing conditions can safely operate in the conditions for ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              131.61318969726562,
              560.5000610351562,
              141.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "which the aircraft was evaluated during the certification ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              144.11318969726562,
              560.4803466796875,
              154.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "process but should never become complacent about icing. ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              156.61318969726562,
              560.5101318359375,
              166.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Even short encounters with small amounts of rough icing ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              169.11318969726562,
              560.5100708007812,
              179.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "can be very hazardous. The pilot should be familiar with all ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              181.61318969726562,
              560.480224609375,
              191.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "information in the Aircraft Flight Manual (AFM) or Pilot’s ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              194.11318969726562,
              560.489990234375,
              204.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Operating Handbook (POH) concerning flight in icing ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              206.61318969726562,
              560.5299072265625,
              216.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "conditions and follow it carefully. Of particular importance ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              219.11318969726562,
              560.5100708007812,
              229.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "are proper operation of ice protection systems and any ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              231.61318969726562,
              560.5399169921875,
              241.61318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "airspeed minimums to be observed during or after flight ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              244.11318969726562,
              560.5205078125,
              254.11318969726562
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "in icing conditions. There are some icing conditions for ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              256.6131896972656,
              560.3703002929688,
              266.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "which no aircraft is evaluated in the certification process, ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              269.1131896972656,
              560.510009765625,
              279.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "such as super-cooled large drops (SLD). These subfreezing ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              281.6131896972656,
              560.5,
              291.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "water droplets, with diameters greater than 50 microns, ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              294.1131896972656,
              560.600830078125,
              304.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "occur within or below clouds and sustained flight in these ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              306.6131896972656,
              560.5101318359375,
              316.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "conditions can be very hazardous. The pilot should be familiar ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              319.1131896972656,
              560.4804077148438,
              329.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "with any information in the AFM or POH relating to these ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              331.6131896972656,
              560.5,
              341.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "conditions, including aircraft-specific cues for recognizing ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              344.1131896972656,
              560.5100708007812,
              354.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "these hazardous conditions within clouds.",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              356.6131896972656,
              487.9300537109375,
              366.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The information in this chapter is an overview of the hazards ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              381.6131896972656,
              560.4994506835938,
              391.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "of aircraft icing. For more detailed information refer to ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              394.1131896972656,
              560.4502563476562,
              404.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "AC 91-74, Pilot Guide: Flight in Icing Conditions, AC 91-",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              406.6131896972656,
              557.9899291992188,
              416.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "51, Effect of Icing on Aircraft Control and Airplane Deice ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              419.1131896972656,
              560.510009765625,
              429.1131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and Anti-Ice Systems, AC 20-73, Aircraft Ice Protection ",
            "font_name": "Times-Roman",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#231F20",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              321.0,
              431.6131896972656,
              560.5396118164062,
              441.6131896972656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and AC 23.143-1, Ice Contaminated Tailplane Stall (ICTS).",
